erdog:</strong> The savior of Crime City. Watch for his laserbeam!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightstalker:</strong> Her cat moves allow her to travel through the vents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disappearing Man:</strong> Not many have actually seen this man...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.poster.avif?t=1763042471\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.webm?t=1763042471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/extras/3e5c68be2c4ddf87383ac8b5a47c31b9.mp4?t=1763042471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "An online co-op horror heist game for up to 5 players. Play as Robbers, sneak around evading Superheroes and pull off the ultimate heist! Use the loot to buy gadgets and face even stronger enemies!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Thai<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/9e0a33bf5d10eff264eeda40629cdbca8be37ebc/header.jpg?t=1763042471", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/e2f77717dce6d0cd225f6d38f01efbe39a291955/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763042471", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626560/e2f77717dce6d0cd225f6d38f01efbe39a291955/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1